      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A variety of drug types are available for the treatment of pain. Significant relief of acute neck pain is usually achievable. Treatment of chronic neck pain requires a more comprehensive rehabilitation approach combined with judicious use of medications. Research on the development of analgesics that affect other neurotransmitter systems and that have fewer side effects is currently underway."},
